cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "nxsa_AI: X-ray Source Detection in XMM-Newton with HDBSCAN"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-09-07"
license: GPL-3.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/davidglt/nxsa_AI"
abstract: >
  Software developed for the Master's Thesis "Detección de fuentes de
  rayos X en XMM-Newton con HDBSCAN" (UNIR, 2026). Implements an
  unsupervised X-ray source detection methodology based on HDBSCAN
  applied to XMM-Newton EPIC-pn event files, including event filtering,
  spatiotemporal feature space construction, HDBSCAN clustering per CCD,
  DS9 region generation, and quantitative validation against the official
  SAS pipeline (precision, recall, F1, angular matching distance).
authors:
